; value-assignment: "v1 OF 20", "v2 OF 30" — connects rashi label to its magnitude
; distinct from has/have/with (shashthi-vibhakti) which signal entity ownership
; sandhi-viveka promotes this to [of, rashi-bandha, rashi-bandha]
; consumed by sankhya-bandha: asprista-sankhya after rashi-bandha binds to preceding label

(bhasha prep-of
  (swarupa preposition)
  (sthita sambandha rashi-bandha))
